  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Non-automatic Weighing Instrument",
    "type_designations": [
      "FL36-SC",
      "200-0000"
    ],
    "description": "Umano Medical hospital beds FL36-SC series (brand names OOK<Snow>, OOK<Snow>MH and OOK<Cocoon>) and 200-0000 series (brand name Ook Snow ALL) incorporating a Class III, mains operated, self-indicating non-automatic weighing instrument. Height and surface contours of the bed are adjustable; includes movable and latchable siderails and control boards. TFT-LCD touch screen display; weighing control and display functions on the footboard; four load cells installed at the four corner positions of the bed base; gravity compensation via accelerometer sensor on the main board; combined semi-automatic zero setting device and semi-automatic tare balancing device. Not to be used for direct sales to the public. Load cell cable and analogue-to-digital converting PCB sealed with tamper-evident labels; calibration counter value written on the rating plate."
